{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38030","headline":"秋深闲兴 · 韩偓","name":"秋深闲兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此心兼笑野云忙，甘得贫闲味甚长。\n病起乍尝新橘柚，秋深初换旧衣裳。\n晴来喜鹊无穷语，雨後寒花特地香。\n把钓覆棊兼举白，不离名教可顚狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}